    <string name="converter_note_time">Month and year are averages: a year has 365.25 days, a month is one twelfth of that.</string>
    <string name="converter_note_fuel">The smaller the value in l/100 km, the more economical the vehicle; for km/l and mpg it is the other way round.</string>
    <string name="converter_note_radix">Whole numbers from 0 only. Roman numerals run from I to MMMCMXCIX (1 to 3999).</string>
    <string name="converter_note_shoe">Guide values for adult shoes, rounded to half sizes. Foot length assumes 1.5 cm of allowance in the shoe. Manufacturers differ; children\'s sizes are not included.</string>
    <string name="converter_note_clothes">Guide values for garment sizes; cut and letter sizes differ between manufacturers. Enter a value from the table in any field to fill the others, e.g. 38 or M.</string>
